# TEST FIXTURE (LABS-1.022): a minimal mechanical profile for installation and subtype tests. Not the D-1 profile.
define
relation part-swap sub event, relates swapped-out as patient, relates swapped-in;   # one specialisation (D-D-6)
physical-object plays part-swap:swapped-out, plays part-swap:swapped-in;
relation maintenance-kind sub classified-as;                                   # how a maintenance event is classified
relation scheduled-maintenance-kind sub maintenance-kind;                      # a deeper subtype
